          <div id='post_4' itemprop="comment" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="http://schema.org/Comment" class='topic-body crawler-post'>
            <div class='crawler-post-meta'>
              <span class="creator" itemprop="author" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="http://schema.org/Person">
                <a rel='nofollow' href='https://discuss.python.org/u/ambv'><span itemprop="name">ambv</span></a>
                  <meta itemprop='url' content='https://discuss.python.org/u/ambv'>
                (Łukasz Langa)
              </span>


                <link itemprop="image" href="https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/flex002/uploads/python1/original/2X/2/2c441545dc69401836f2d6061e5ed827b2cb9fad.jpeg">

              <span class="crawler-post-infos">
                  <time itemprop="datePublished" datetime='2023-01-10T17:31:53Z' class='post-time'>
                    January 10, 2023,  5:31pm
                  </time>
                  <meta itemprop='dateModified' content='2023-01-10T17:31:53Z'>
              <span itemprop="position">4</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class='post' itemprop="text">
              <p>I’m happy to see enthusiasm for the PEP. However, <strong>please note</strong> that on Discourse we avoid posts to show support / agree with the previous poster. Instead, we use the reactions:</p>
<p><div class="lightbox-wrapper"><a class="lightbox" href="https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/flex002/uploads/python1/original/2X/2/2c441545dc69401836f2d6061e5ed827b2cb9fad.jpeg" data-download-href="/uploads/short-url/6jASjAjkxyGWKxoaWiUz2KEUtpH.jpeg?dl=1" title="Screen Shot 2023-01-10 at 18.30.10"><img src="https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/flex002/uploads/python1/optimized/2X/2/2c441545dc69401836f2d6061e5ed827b2cb9fad_2_502x499.jpeg" alt="Screen Shot 2023-01-10 at 18.30.10" data-base62-sha1="6jASjAjkxyGWKxoaWiUz2KEUtpH" width="502" height="499" srcset="https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/flex002/uploads/python1/optimized/2X/2/2c441545dc69401836f2d6061e5ed827b2cb9fad_2_502x499.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/flex002/uploads/python1/optimized/2X/2/2c441545dc69401836f2d6061e5ed827b2cb9fad_2_753x748.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/flex002/uploads/python1/optimized/2X/2/2c441545dc69401836f2d6061e5ed827b2cb9fad_2_1004x998.jpeg 2x" data-dominant-color="2C2C2D"><div class="meta">
<svg class="fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#far-image"></use></svg><span class="filename">Screen Shot 2023-01-10 at 18.30.10</span><span class="informations">1824×1816 152 KB</span><svg class="fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#discourse-expand"></use></svg>
</div></a></div></p>
<p>Please use those instead. Thanks!</p>
            </div>

