              <span itemprop="position">13</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class='post' itemprop="text">
              <aside class="quote group-committers" data-username="methane" data-post="9" data-topic="22606">
<div class="title">
<div class="quote-controls"></div>
<img loading="lazy" alt="" width="24" height="24" src="https://sea2.discourse-cdn.com/flex016/user_avatar/discuss.python.org/methane/48/43_2.png" class="avatar"> Inada Naoki:</div>
<blockquote>
<p>I prefer <code>--enable-gil / --disable-gil</code> option.</p>
</blockquote>
</aside>
<p>I like <code>--enable-gil / --disable-gil</code> too. I’ll wait a bit to see if there are additional comments on the build option naming and then update the PEP.</p>
            </div>

